# ─── PRODUCTION (Vercel) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Points to the Render backend so all API/OAuth2 calls go to the correct server.
# This file is committed and used when Vite builds for production (`vite build`).
# You can also override this in Vercel Dashboard → Settings → Environment Variables.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://kora-job-portal-backend.onrender.com
